    "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\n- Fix #27894: SP + PP force-enabled `+rms_norm` since native rms_norm broke tracing\r\n- Obsolete now: RMSNorm always traces as an opaque vLLM IR op\r\n- IR lowering picks the impl after the SP pass, so shapes always match\r\n- The append was also dead: fusion defaults resolve before it runs\r\n\r\n## Test\r\n\r\n- New regression test: SP + PP generation with `custom_ops=[\"-rms_norm\"]`\r\n- Manual repro from #27894 on 4x L4 (nightly wheel, TP2 x PP2): runs clean\r\n- `+rms_norm` vs `-rms_norm` outputs bit-identical; matches TP-only baseline\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAI assistance was used for this change (Claude); every line was reviewed by the submitter.\r\n",
